# GEODESIC credentials: EXAMPLE
#
# Copy to <project directory>/credentials.env or ~/.config/geodesic/credentials.env
# (both untracked), or set the variables in your environment instead.
# Credentials are never written to the database, exports, raw-response archives or logs.
#
# No credential is needed for the default connectors (Europe PMC search and
# open-access full text, Crossref public API).

# Optional: Crossref Plus token, if your institution has one.
# GEODESIC_CROSSREF_PLUS_TOKEN=
